cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it as below and include the HSE
  acknowledgement: "Contains public sector information published by the Health
  and Safety Executive and licensed under the Open Government Licence."
type: dataset
title: UK construction injury statistics by ComplyOnSite
abstract: >-
  Tidy long-format CSV and JSON copy of Health and Safety Executive workplace
  fatal and non-fatal injury and work-related ill-health statistics for Great
  Britain (RIDDOR and Labour Force Survey), with a construction-only file and
  Datawrapper-ready chart extracts. Built from HSE's 1 July 2026 fatal injury
  release and 20 November 2025 annual statistics release.
authors:
  - name: ComplyOnSite
    website: https://complyonsite.com/
date-released: 2026-10-03
